      "settings": {
        "custom_text_custm": "<p>A lab-grown diamond's overall quality and value are determined by the 4Cs -<a href=\"https://thefuturerocks.com/blogs/news/everything-to-know-about-lab-grown-diamond-cuts\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>Cut</em></span></a>,<a href=\"https://thefuturerocks.com/blogs/news/understanding-the-diamond-color\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>Color</em></span></a>,<a href=\"https://thefuturerocks.com/blogs/news/a-complete-guide-to-diamond-carats\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>Carat weight</em></span></a>, and<a href=\"https://thefuturerocks.com/blogs/news/the-importance-of-diamond-clarity\"> <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em>Clarity</em></span></a>. Our lab-grown diamonds are IGI certified, ensuring quality, transparency, and a commitment to sustainable practices.</p>"
      }
